msgstr "Neste exercício, escreva as anotações {cells}."

#. Translators: said when a note cannot go in a cell, as in "The 2 cannot go here: it is already in the column 1."
msgid "The {number} cannot go here: it is already in {group}."
msgstr "O {number} não pode ir aqui: já está {group}."

#. Translators: said when deleting a right number in an exercise about deleting the wrong ones.
msgid "That number is right. Look for the wrong one."
msgstr "Esse número está certo. Procure o errado."

